foundation-p2 = prose (cons "The subject is the receptivity and transparency of systems: (receptivity + transparency) × (receptivity + transparency) ⇒ (receptivity + transparency). An enlightened cut or subnetwork functions as an information channel between everything around it, and so produces greater enlightenment. Enlightenment is the release of ignorance, that is, of irrational internal distinctions that do not survive contact with rationality and reality, and it facilitates further enlightenment. The etymology is the relevant sense: to enlighten is to shed light (Tattvārtha Sūtra 8.2, 10.2)." nil)
